SUMMARY:Two Guys\, One GCSE
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Dave and Liam are thicker than your average chancers: men of mi
 splaced confidence with the audacity of blokes who've never let a GCSE get 
 in their way. Join these lovable halfwits from London and Newcastle as they
  aim high\, miss low and celebrate a life of glorious mediocrity. From the 
 bottom of the class to the back of the bus\, their pursuit of crappiness is
  relentless\, unapologetic and dangerously enthusiastic. Expect big egos\, 
 questionable judgement and a masterclass in regrets\, debts\, detentions an
 d delusions.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/two-guy
 s-one-gcse/
